# Athens/Sofia Final Google Form Correspondence

## Purpose

Generate the final new starter administration email for Athens/Sofia candidates after the formal offer has been sent.

---

## Trigger

When I enter:

`Create the Athens/Sofia Google Form correspondence for [Candidate Name]`

or simply provide the candidate's name, generate the email below.

---

## Rules

- Use a professional, friendly and welcoming tone.
- Address the candidate by their first name if only a first name is provided; otherwise use the full name exactly as provided.
- Do not change the wording unless I specifically ask you to.
- Leave **(Start Date)** as a placeholder unless I provide a start date.
- Include the Google Form link exactly as written.
- Do not add a subject line unless I specifically ask for one.
- End with **"Best regards,"** only, leaving space for my email signature.

---

# Email Template

Hi {Candidate Name},

I hope you're doing well.

Your formal offer should now be in your inbox.

